---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '../../components/Breadcrumb.astro';
import LinkHub from '../../components/LinkHub.astro';
import { SITE, withBase, absUrl } from '../../site';
import { OPENING_HOURS } from '../../data/hours';

// DU1 (Radar eventos-madrid-2026-10-24): Halloween party at Dubliners, Sat 31 Oct 2026 from 19:00,
// costumes, decorations and music. Source: owner via DG 23 Oct (fixtures.ts kind:'event' row) + DG 24 Oct 01:06.
// EN main page; ES pair /es/halloween-madrid-2026/ added 24 Oct (DG HALLOWEEN). No prices, bookings, contests or promos; no "walk-in" (banned on the site).
// ARCHIVED 2 Nov 2026 (routine 0b): event took place Sat 31 Oct; past tense, Event JSON-LD removed, same URL.
const sat = OPENING_HOURS.find((d) => d.day === 'Saturday')!;
const faqLd = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'FAQPage',
  mainEntity: [
    { '@type': 'Question', name: 'When was the Halloween party at Dubliners?', acceptedAnswer: { '@type': 'Answer', text: 'It took place on Saturday 31 October 2026, from 19:00 Madrid time. Check What\'s On for upcoming events and live sport.' } },
    { '@type': 'Question', name: 'Where was it?', acceptedAnswer: { '@type': 'Answer', text: 'At Dubliners Irish Pub, Calle de Espoz y Mina 7, 28012 Madrid, a short walk from Puerta del Sol. Metro Sol (lines 1, 2 and 3) or Sevilla (line 2).' } },
    { '@type': 'Question', name: 'Is it in English?', acceptedAnswer: { '@type': 'Answer', text: 'Yes. Dubliners is an English-speaking Irish pub, so tourists, Erasmus and international students will feel at home.' } },
    { '@type': 'Question', name: 'What was it like?', acceptedAnswer: { '@type': 'Answer', text: 'Costumes, Halloween decorations and music all night.' } },
  ],
};
---

<BaseLayout title={'Halloween in Madrid near Sol 2026: Irish pub party in English | Dubliners'} description={'Halloween 2026 at Dubliners, an international Irish pub at Espoz y Mina 7 near Puerta del Sol, took place on Sat 31 Oct with costumes, decorations and music. See What\'s On for upcoming events.'} path="/halloween-madrid-2026/" lang="en" hreflang={{ en: '/halloween-madrid-2026/', es: '/es/halloween-madrid-2026/' }} ogImage="/images/facade-queue.jpg" extraJsonLd={[faqLd]}>
  <section class="hero hero-compact">
    <div class="container">
      <Breadcrumb current={'Halloween in Madrid'} schema />
      <h1>Halloween in Madrid near Sol: party in English at Dubliners</h1>
      <p class="lead">Halloween 2026 at Dubliners took place on Saturday 31 October from 19:00: costumes, spooky decorations and music, in an international, English-speaking Irish pub at Espoz y Mina 7, a short walk from Puerta del Sol. Thanks to everyone who came! For what's next, see <a href={withBase('/whats-on/')}>What's On</a>.</p>
      <p class="small">This event has finished · Saturday 31 October 2026 · Calle de Espoz y Mina 7 · Updated 2 November 2026</p>
      <p class="small">En español: <a href={withBase('/es/halloween-madrid-2026/')} hreflang="es" lang="es">Halloween en Madrid junto a Sol</a></p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="btn btn-gold" data-track-event="directions_click" href={SITE.mapsUrl} rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Directions</a>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href={withBase('/contact/#request-information')}>Request information</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h2>A Halloween night out in English</h2>
      <p>New in town, here on holiday or studying abroad? Halloween is the perfect night to meet people. At Dubliners the staff speak English, the music is on and the whole pub dresses up for the night, so you can enjoy Halloween in Madrid without worrying about the language.</p>
      <picture><source type="image/webp" srcset={`${withBase('/images/facade-queue-sm.webp')} 640w, ${withBase('/images/facade-queue.webp')} 1320w`} sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 720px" /><img class="split-photo landscape" src={withBase('/images/facade-queue.jpg')} width="1320" height="986" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="People queuing at the door of Dubliners at night, Espoz y Mina 7, off Puerta del Sol" /></picture>
      <h2>What the night had</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Costumes:</strong> witches, zombies, vampires and more.</li>
        <li><strong>Decorations:</strong> the pub was decorated for Halloween.</li>
        <li><strong>Music:</strong> a party atmosphere from 19:00 until late.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>For tourists, Erasmus and groups</h2>
      <p>Whether you are visiting Madrid for the weekend, on an Erasmus year or organising a night out with your flatmates, classmates or colleagues, Dubliners is an easy place to start the night: a few steps from Puerta del Sol, close to Plaza Mayor and the Barrio de las Letras. Coming with a big group? Send us a message through <a href={withBase('/contact/#request-information')}>Request information</a>.</p>
      <h2>When and where</h2>
      <p><strong>Saturday 31 October 2026, from 19:00</strong> (event finished).</p>
      <p>Dubliners Irish Pub, Calle de Espoz y Mina 7, 28012 Madrid. Metro Sol (lines 1, 2 and 3) or Sevilla (line 2).</p>
      <h2>Opening hours</h2>
      <ul>{OPENING_HOURS.map((d) => <li>{d.day}: {d.opens}–{d.closes}</li>)}</ul>
      <h2>FAQ</h2>
      <dl class="faq">
        <dt><strong>When was the Halloween party at Dubliners?</strong></dt><dd>It took place on Saturday 31 October 2026, from 19:00 Madrid time. Check <a href={withBase('/whats-on/')}>What's On</a> for upcoming events and live sport.</dd>
        <dt><strong>Where was it?</strong></dt><dd>At Dubliners Irish Pub, Calle de Espoz y Mina 7, 28012 Madrid, a short walk from Puerta del Sol. Metro Sol (lines 1, 2 and 3) or Sevilla (line 2).</dd>
        <dt><strong>Is it in English?</strong></dt><dd>Yes. Dubliners is an English-speaking Irish pub, so tourists, Erasmus and international students will feel at home.</dd>
        <dt><strong>What was it like?</strong></dt><dd>Costumes, Halloween decorations and music all night.</dd>
      </dl>
      <LinkHub
        heading="h2"
        groups={[
          {
            title: 'More at Dubliners',
            items: [
              { href: '/whats-on/', label: "What's On", note: 'Events and live sport' },
              { href: '/international-students-pub-madrid/', label: 'Erasmus & international students' },
              { href: '/es/halloween-madrid-2026/', label: 'Halloween en Madrid junto a Sol', note: 'En español', hreflang: 'es', lang: 'es' },
              { href: '/night-out-near-sol-madrid/', label: 'Night out near Sol' },
              { href: '/visit/', label: 'Opening hours & map' },
            ],
          },
        ]}
      />
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
